/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 37 122 [
[(Caveat -- this only works if Pd actually gets the key events)]
[(which can depend on the stacking order of windows and/or the)]
[(mouse pointer location, depending on the system. Also note that)]
[(typical computer keyboards will only allow you to press a few)]
[(keys simultaneously.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
